{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果日前發佈 iOS 27.2.1 版更新，此次更新主要是修復已知問題和安全漏洞，其中值得關注的是涉及 iMessage 羣聊和藍牙配對中的安全漏洞，這些漏洞可能會帶來私隱風險。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585688.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.166374+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T05:33:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"23b8eb893f38aac801efab212998a6fbadb98281c88e045fc4459419fcdc9a04","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}